          "text": ".subckt TL072 inp inn out vp vn\n* input: offset (data sheet typ), voltage noise, bias currents (+ = into the pin), resistance\nVos inp i1 DC 0.003\n* spread Vos -0.01 0.01 offset (data sheet: max 10 mV either way)\nEn i1 i2 nz 0 9.08785\nRnz nz 0 1k\nIbp inp vn DC 6.5e-11\nIbn inn vn DC 6.5e-11\n* spread Ibp 6.5e-11 2e-10 ib+ (data sheet: typ 65 pA, max 200 pA; no min, so from typ)\n* spread Ibn 6.5e-11 2e-10 ib- (data sheet: typ 65 pA, max 200 pA; no min, so from typ)\nRin inp inn 1e12\n* gain stage: gm into Cp || Rp; the current is limited to SR * Cp (slew rate)\nBgm 0 n0 I=limit(0.0397892*V(i2,inn),-0.02,0.02)\nRp n0 0 5.02615e+06\nCp n0 0 1e-09\n* second pole (phase margin)\nE2 p2a 0 n0 0 1\nR2 p2a p2 1k\nC2 p2 0 2.04479e-11\n* output swing: clamped hu below vp and hl above vn\nEu u 0 vp 0 1\nVhu u uh DC 1.4\nEx1 x1 0 p2 uh 1000\nD1 x1 y1 DLIM\nRy1 y1 0 1k\nEy1 y1k 0 y1 0 0.001\nEc1 n1 0 p2 y1k 1\nEl l 0 vn 0 1\nVtop u ut DC -0.5\nDtop n0 ut DLIM\nVbot l lb DC 0.5\nDbot lb n0 DLIM\nVhl lh l DC 1.4\nEx2 x2 0 lh n1 1000\nD2 x2 y2 DLIM\nRy2 y2 0 1k\nEy2 y2k 0 0 y2 0.001\nEc2 n 0 n1 y2k 1\n* output: ro, current limited to the short-circuit current, taken from vp (source) and returned to vn (sink)\nBsrc vp out I=limit((V(n)-V(out))/100,-0.026,0.026)*step(limit((V(n)-V(out))/100,-0.026,0.026),1u)\nBsnk out vn I=-limit((V(n)-V(out))/100,-0.026,0.026)*step(-limit((V(n)-V(out))/100,-0.026,0.026),1u)\n* quiescent current of one amplifier\nIq vp vn DC 0.0014\n* spread Iq 0.0014 0.0025 iq (data sheet: typ 1.4 mA, max 2.5 mA; no min, so from typ)\n.model DLIM D(IS=1e-12 N=1)\n.ends TL072"
        }
